.env

# A CV tailored to one company names that company. This repository is public, so a
# committed application publishes who you applied to and lets any reader enumerate the
# others. The public CV is profiles/; everything per-application lives here and leaves the
# machine only as an attached PDF. tests/ApplicationsStayLocal.test.js enforces it.
applications/